---
// Added in the figures pass: numbers come from the post text and captures.
const W = 900, H = 280;
---
<figure class="bep5c">
  <div class="bep5c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: three requests all connect to one shared module-level session, labelled no rollback after an error and shared across threads, drawn in red. Right: each of three requests has its own session, closed when the request ends.">
    <text x="60" y="52" text-anchor="start" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>module-level SessionLocal()</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SessionLocal() ở cấp module</tspan></text>
    <rect x="60" y="76" width="120" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="120" y="99" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>request 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 1</tspan></text>
    <line x1="180" y1="94" x2="300" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <rect x="60" y="128" width="120" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="120" y="151" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>request 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 2</tspan></text>
    <line x1="180" y1="146" x2="300" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <rect x="60" y="180" width="120" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="120" y="203" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>request 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 3</tspan></text>
    <line x1="180" y1="198" x2="300" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <rect x="300" y="100" width="200" height="76" rx="10" class="badfill" />
    <text x="400" y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>one shared session</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một session dùng chung</tspan></text>
    <text x="400" y="152" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>no rollback after an error</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không rollback sau lỗi</tspan></text>
    <text x="400" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>shared across threads</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dùng chung giữa các thread</tspan></text>
    <line x1="560" y1="50" x2="560" y2="250" class="seam" />
    <text x="620" y="52" text-anchor="start" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>session per request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi request một session</tspan></text>
    <rect x="620" y="76" width="120" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="680" y="99" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>request 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 1</tspan></text>
    <line x1="740" y1="94" x2="770" y2="94" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="780,94 770,89 770,99" class="hd" />
    <rect x="780" y="76" width="90" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="825" y="99" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>session</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session</tspan></text>
    <rect x="620" y="128" width="120" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="680" y="151" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>request 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 2</tspan></text>
    <line x1="740" y1="146" x2="770" y2="146" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="780,146 770,141 770,151" class="hd" />
    <rect x="780" y="128" width="90" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="825" y="151" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>session</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session</tspan></text>
    <rect x="620" y="180" width="120" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="680" y="203" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>request 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 3</tspan></text>
    <line x1="740" y1="198" x2="770" y2="198" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="780,198 770,193 770,203" class="hd" />
    <rect x="780" y="180" width="90" height="36" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="825" y="203" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>session</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session</tspan></text>
    <text x="620" y="250" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>closed when the request ends</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đóng khi request kết thúc</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The session is the transaction's lifetime, so it has to be exactly one request long.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Session là vòng đời của transaction, nên nó phải dài đúng bằng một request.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5c text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5c .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5c .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5c .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5c .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5c .badfill { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5c .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5c .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5c .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5c .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5c .dotbad { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5c .slot { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
